# DAG: noise_floor_rel=5e-2 experiment (see condor/train_pa_xas_noisefloor.sub
# and memory logdet_bias_isolated.md). TRAIN builds
# checkpoints/phenomd_nonspinning_dense30_phase_amplitude_xas_noisefloor.pt;
# SCAN (unsmoothed with-K NS at q=0.50/0.60/0.80) needs that checkpoint, so
# it's a child of TRAIN.
#
# Submit from /scratch/wiay/daniel/heron-dense45 on wiay:
#   condor_submit_dag condor/dag_noisefloor.dag
# Monitor: condor_q daniel -all ; tail -f condor/dag_noisefloor.dag.dagman.out

